  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: "25 · Gradient mapper"
  description: "Gradient mapping: the sprite's grayscale value is used as the U coordinate of a gradient texture. GradientMapper.cs bakes a Unity Gradient into such a texture: enable 'testing' on a sprite to edit its gradient live, and press 'Make Gradient Map' in its inspector to save it as a PNG in Assets/GradientMaps.\nLeft column: original grayscale sprites."
  controls: "\nN / B: next / previous demo · M: menu · H: hide this panel"
  showPanel: 1
